  <Docs>
    <summary>Identifies the reason that an SDK load request failed.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>The .NET binding groups the SDK load error constants from <see cref="T:Android.App.SdkSandbox.SdkSandboxManager" /> in this enumeration. <see cref="P:Android.App.SdkSandbox.LoadSdkException.LoadSdkErrorCode" /> reports one of these codes.</para>
      <para>The <see href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/AdServices/+/refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r1/sdksandbox/framework/java/android/app/sdksandbox/SdkSandboxManager.java">Android 16 error-code declaration</see> lists the permitted values in its <c>LoadSdkErrorCode</c> integer definition; the values are error codes, not flags.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
