      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>SDK is already loaded.</para>
          <para>This indicates that client application tried to reload the same SDK by calling SdkSandboxManager.loadSdk(String,Bundle,Executor,OutcomeReceiver) after being successfully loaded.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/sdksandbox/SdkSandboxManager#LOAD_SDK_ALREADY_LOADED" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.sdksandbox.SdkSandboxManager.LOAD_SDK_ALREADY_LOADED</code>.</a></format></para>
