        <summary>
          <para>SDK error after being loaded.</para>
          <para>This indicates that the SDK encountered an error during post-load initialization. The details of this can be obtained from the Bundle returned in LoadSdkException through the OutcomeReceiver passed in to SdkSandboxManager.loadSdk.</para>
